Q&oe=6A7879F8"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_3.png", "id": "1279491047106913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822355_1279491053773579_8256426468449689057_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wrA9eaMuS1gQ7kNvwEZTlfR&_nc_oc=AdplsO9YtZxx6g2ZF-zOC61g-xEEhpxzRGyrGsAAz4V_-P9wIjRrpLZ8L4JY4kYRY04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFE4KffjhasU7rrQhqcPGWE2goQZHnUQKuuJX2dZEj2ow&oe=6A7880E3"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_7.png", "id": "1263417775269909", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_1263417778603242_5246940430776269009_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xmfSOAuXXq0Q7kNvwGtHUKM&_nc_oc=AdokAxQ1Q5L4dDl5aq-2YEgTwN2ettpLhsQZtiMzoSRKrGsdq9kVG8h4_4HqYfCMWTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFBt1d8FYXssUfvNec9Qfg7MRaa2CGzJEcLQo-ZoNgIzA&oe=6A786AED"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR", "keywords": ["ForkliftSimulator", "ForkliftExtremeSimulator", "ForklifDriver", "ForkliftDrivingSimulator"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate VR forklift experience with **Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR** \ud83d\udea7\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f! Whether you\u2019re a professional aiming to refine your skills or a VR enthusiast craving realistic machinery gameplay, this simulator delivers immersive, hands-on forklift operation like never before.\n\n**Realistic Controls & Physics** \u2699\ufe0f\ud83d\udce6: Feel the weight, balance, and precision of operating a real forklift. Use authentic controls to lift, stack, and transport pallets through a highly detailed warehouse environment with dynamic interactions.\n\n**Challenging Missions** \ud83c\udfaf\ud83d\udd25: Complete a wide range of tasks, from careful pallet stacking to time-based loading challenges. Each mission pushes your accuracy, coordination, and decision-making skills to the limit.\n\n**Multiple Forklift Types** \ud83d\ude9c\ud83d\udd27: Choose from various forklift models, including counterbalance forklifts, reach trucks, and pallet jacks\u2014each offering unique handling and realistic mechanics.\n\n**Immersive VR Environment** \ud83c\udf10\ud83c\udfa7: Designed for VR headsets like Meta Quest, experience full 360-degree interaction, realistic sound effects, and detailed warehouse layouts that make you feel truly present.\n\n**Skill Progression** \ud83d\udcc8\ud83c\udfc6: Improve your abilities as you unlock advanced levels, tougher challenges, and performance-based achievements.\n\nEnjoy a perfect blend of training and fun as you master lifting, stacking, and precision handling \ud83d\udcaa\u2728!", "short_description": "Step into a realistic forklift driving experience in immersive VR \ud83d\udea7. Take control of powerful machines, navigate tight warehouse spaces, and handle cargo with precision \ud83d\udce6. Complete challenging tasks, improve your skills, and unlock new levels as you progress \ud83c\udfaf. Enjoy smooth controls, detailed environments, and engaging gameplay that puts you in the driver\u2019s seat \ud83d\ude9c. Become a skilled forklift operator and master every challenge \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udfc6!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhub-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Horizon Hub", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhubcom/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null,